		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Draw the HUD from the high-res redraws; off\ndraws the game's own pictures."/>
		<string text="Draw text and titles with high-res fonts; off\ndraws the game's own."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges, which the Xbox did not. FXAA\nand SMAA are cheap; SSAA and MSAA are sharper."/>
		<string text="Smooth jagged edges, which the Xbox did not. FXAA\nis cheap; MSAA is sharper."/>
		<string text="The size objects' shadows are drawn at: 128 as on\nthe Xbox; larger for smoother, as soft, edges."/>
		<string text="Light models for each pixel, without the facets\nof the Xbox's lighting for each vertex."/>
		<string text="Shields light their surroundings as they flare,\nin the shield's own color."/>
		<string text="Light Show: the shield glow three times as\nbright and as far."/>
